OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 6, dies after family killed
OL,4,Ain sea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old girl has died in
OL,7,Fhospital after getting into difficulty
OL,8,Fin the sea off Shoreham in West Sussex,
OL,9,Fin an incident which also killed three
OL,10,Fof her family members.
OL,12,FSaja El-Khawas, a British Palestinian,
OL,13,Fwas pulled from the sea by emergency
OL,14,Fcrews on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThis breaking news story is being
OL,17,Fupdated and more details will be
OL,18,Fpublished shortly. Please refresh the
OL,19,Fpage for the fullest version.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
